<title>HONG KONG: USI Holdings interim net up 15.3 pct.</title>
<headline>USI Holdings interim net up 15.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   6.8    vs 8.5 (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.0    vs 1.5 (see note)</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    21.80  vs 18.90</p>
<p>    Turnover		     628.70 vs 622.80</p>
<p>    Company name		 USI Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 1-4</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 8</p>
<p>NOTE - USI Holdings is a garment manufacturer. Figures for earnings per share and interim dividend have been adjusted for the effects of share consolidation made in June 1996 and rights issue made in July 1995.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
